id: addons-search-hide-key
section: Keyboard and text
item: Focus about:addons' search field, type on the keyboard, then close the keyboard with its hide key: the field keeps the text and no caret is left; a tap on the field brings the keyboard back
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: about:addons
kit: cavekit-chrome-look.md R4
wait rect 'sel:#header-search' 40
calibrate 'sel:#header-search'
tap 'sel:#header-search'
expect keyboard up 8
type-keys pale
wait still 'sel:#header-search' 3
chrome kb-hide
expect keyboard down 8
wait still 'sel:#header-search' 3
sample field 'sel:#header-search'
wait still 'sel:#header-search' 3
expect region-equal 'sel:#header-search' field
tap 'sel:#header-search'
expect keyboard up 8
